  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed change of use would, by reason of a loss of residential floorspace, cause harm to the locality due to a loss of housing stock. This is contrary to Policy LP25 of the Local Plan and Policy H8 of the London Plan. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed development, would by reason of a lack of sequential test, fail to demonstrate that the use of the site as temporary accommodation is appropriate to the locality. The proposal therefore fails to comply with LP2 and LP46 of the Local Plan. ",
